    "plugin.center.review.hookEvent.clipboardCaptureFailed": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"When saving a clipboard item fails"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"クリップボード項目の保存に失敗したとき"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保存剪贴板项目失败时"}}}},
